{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>As she made you swear.</b> And were it not for the oath I would not let you go — but he was afraid to say 'transgress the oath,' lest he say: If so, I will transgress the oath that I swore to you, that I not reveal, in the Holy Tongue, that I recognize [you as] superior to seventy tongues, while you do not recognize it — as is found in tractate Sotah."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 50, :notes {0 "Reading עוֹדֵף עַל ע' לָשׁוֹן literally: Pharaoh recognizes, through the Holy Tongue, that Joseph ranks above (עודף על) seventy tongues/languages; this alludes to the midrash in Sotah 36b that Joseph survived Pharaoh's test of seventy languages."}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:04:24.611268232Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}